# Build-context filter for docker/bridge/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in
# preference to a context-root .dockerignore). The context is the repo root, but the bridge image only
# needs the build definition plus :protocol, :core:model and :bridge — everything else is transfer cost
# (the bundled card catalog under core/cards alone is tens of MB) and would invalidate layers on edits
# that cannot affect the bridge.
**/build
**/.gradle
.git
.claude
.idea
app
feature
tools
docs
core/*
!core/model
